# Work Mode prototype

Standalone Vite + React UI for AgentSam Work Mode. Production wiring targets **AgentSamRemix** (see `INTEGRATION.md`, `docs/AUTH_EXECOS_WIRING.md`).

## Stack

- **Frontend**: React 19, Vite 6, Tailwind 4, TypeScript
- **Local API**: `server.ts` (Express) — proxies platform APIs when `VITE_IAM_ORIGIN` is set
- **Deploy**: Cloudflare Workers static assets via `wrangler.jsonc`

## Key scripts

| Script | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `npm run dev` | Vite + Express full stack |
| `npm run build:static` | Production UI → `dist/` |
| `npm run preview:worker` | Build + `wrangler dev` |
| `npm run deploy` | Build + `wrangler deploy` |
| `npm run lint` | Typecheck (`tsc --noEmit`) |

## Important paths

- `wrangler.jsonc` — Worker name and assets config
- `src/lib/wranglerCommandCatalog.ts` — Cmd+K Wrangler command catalog
- `src/components/shell/CfUnifiedCommandPalette.tsx` — Cloudflare command palette UI
- `patches/` — Integration patches for AgentSamRemix (0001–0005)
- `.env.example` — `VITE_IAM_ORIGIN`, `VITE_WORKSPACE_ID`, storage backend

## Conventions

- Minimize scope; match existing patterns in surrounding files.
- Do not add unrelated refactors when fixing a targeted issue.
- Patches in `patches/` are applied to AgentSamRemix separately — keep catalog/command changes in sync when touching Wrangler or gh CLI surfaces.
